Package: com.m3ga.m3gasignalbars
Name: M3gaSignalBars
Version: 0.1.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Cosmetic full-strength cellular signal bars for classic iOS 6.
 Displays five full native iOS 6 cellular signal bars when enabled and restores
 the real modem signal display when disabled. This does not improve reception
 or create service. Includes Enable Fake Cell Bars, About the Tweak, Instructions,
 Info About Me, and the creator's website link.
Maintainer: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Author: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0)
